  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A narrow gold circlet set with one pale stone. The stone is never the same color twice, and those who wear the crown stop blinking as often as other people do.</p><p>While you wear this crown, you have Immunity to the Charmed and Frightened conditions, you need no sleep, and you can speak mind to mind with any creature you can see within 120 feet.</p><p><strong>Bend the Will.</strong> Once per day you can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDominateMo]{Dominate Monster} (save DC 20) from the crown. It regains this power at dawn.</p><p><strong>The Crown Listens.</strong> The crown has heard every thought of everyone who ever wore it, and it will share them, one memory for each night the wearer goes without dreaming. It never lies, but it chooses what to tell.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
